Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这有点疯狂   不过我认为也许能行得通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I know it sounds crazy, but I think it might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的问题是卡尔的演技\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the only problem is Carl's acting is:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  他害我两年前  痛失那条果汁大广告  记得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. He's the reason I didn't get that big Minute Maid commercial a couple of years ago remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们演兄弟   他却搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were supposed to be brothers, but he messed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   我可以吃一小块蛋糕吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Can I get a little piece of that cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼萨  我们爱吃彼萨  滚出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pizza. We like pizza. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派特赛贾克  可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pat Sajak? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亚历崔贝克  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Alex Trebek? Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恰克乌勒利  绝对行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chuck Woolery? Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的综艺节目主持人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you will not find a single game-show host...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都能修理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...whose ass I cannot kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说  说我们是Unagi\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say it. Say we are unagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你是不是  是你有没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not something you are, it's something you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以轻易挣脱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could easily get out of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们可能会死得很惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but there's a chance you could get very, very hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  卡尔  接着就是我们  记住  这次不能怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Carl, we're next. Now, remember, what is this not gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重蹈那次果汁广告的覆辙  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Another Minute Maid fiasco. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what are you not gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能讲话  因为  你还讲  卡尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna talk, because-Ah. Damn it, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我下一组的资料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I have the next one, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊和汤尼崔比亚尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey and Tony Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是这是双胞胎的研究\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, uh, this is a study for identical twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错啊   两千块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. Two thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们不是双胞胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're not identical twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是你啦  卡尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你最爱吃的食物倒数\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Continuing the countdown of your favorite meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚  第三名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tonight, number three:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起司通心粉加切丁的热狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}macaroni and cheese with cut-up hot dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对我够好了  别再费心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, you have done enough, okay? You have to stop this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的  但不是今晚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will, but not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚餐音乐   就来听你录的带子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For dinner music, I thought we could listen to that tape that you made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  那卷合辑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, the mixed tape. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I'm awfully low
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚好有收录《你今晚的模样》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. "The Way You Look Tonight" is on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陪我跳舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dance with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.53,0:18:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will feel a glow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just thinking of you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the way you look tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好最好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are just the sweetest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你每晚的模样我都爱  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love the way you look every night, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我录这卷带子给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's why I made you this tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐  爱你的  珍妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy birthday. Love, Janice. Mwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好最好了  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you're the sweetest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐们  今天的课到此为止  记住  一定要平安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, ladies, that ends today's class. Let's remember, let's be safe out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你教得真好  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great class. Heh. Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得很仔细\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. I was watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  不过我有一些问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, hey, a couple of questions, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才最后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, you know that last move...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人把你绊倒  压在地上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...where that woman tripped you and then pinned you to the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你接下来会怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What would you do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会拿钥匙来刺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then she'd take her keys and jam them in your--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是  是你会怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. What would you do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说攻击者  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who, me, the attacker? Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想偷袭两个女人  却没成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I tried attacking two women. Did not work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No, I mean, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们是我的朋友  我还跟其中一个结过婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, they're my friends. In fact, I was married to one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说白了  你偷袭你的前妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me get this straight. You attacked your ex-wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试图偷袭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却打不过她   所以才来找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I couldn't. That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以一起对付她们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we could attack them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常非常非常对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so, so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会下厨房煮你想吃的菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! And I will cook anything you want in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进卧室玩你想玩的花样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and do anything you want in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然得煮   你想得美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you will, and are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  莫尼卡   这是我们的情人节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Monica, it's our Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  求你了  拜托啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, please, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay. okay
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My funny valentine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sweet comic valentine You make me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要进房间了吗   我要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So are we going in there? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your looks are laughable
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们逃不掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢坐这里   我要过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't like sitting up here. I'm gonna go over--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  是他们先来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Rachel, they got here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯在干嘛   危险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is Ross doing that? Danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  他干嘛扑向那两个女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Why is he jumping on those women?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该去帮她们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看她们不需要帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think they need any help.
